# Keep secrets, local data and build artefacts out of the image.
#
# Note: the Dockerfile already uses explicit per-path COPYs rather than
# `COPY . .`, so .env would not be included even without this file. This is
# defence in depth — it also keeps the build context small (the local venv is
# several hundred MB) and stops stale .pyc files from shadowing fresh source.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Local-only tender corpus (client data — never shipped)
../QuantumCrewBD-local-tenders/
fixtures-local/

# Python
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# VCS / editor / OS
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Docs and probes not needed at runtime
*.md
!README.md
/tmp/
